WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:15,400
Dashan takes the shrimp in the pot, here it comes, brother

2
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,400
Where did you get so many big shrimps?

3
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,400
Don't ask yet

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,400
Hurry up and pretend

5
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:31,210
Don't wait to die

6
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:33,210
Walk, walk, sit
